Ben is in the classroom in his new school in
Palestine. He sits next to Omar. Omar’s twin
sister Rania sits behind him.
Ben shows Omar a picture of his family.
Omar looks at his parents and his sister.
Omar looks at a picture of Ben’s dad. He’s in
a walking race. His mum helps his dad. She
has a bottle of water in her hand.
Rania, Ben and Omar talk about what they
like doing. Rania likes looking at cats on the
internet. Omar and Ben both like watching
films at the cinema. Ben likes writing emails.
Hi, I’m Omar. This is my sister
Rania. We’re twins. We’re 11
years old. What’s your name?
Welcome to Palestine! I like
drawing pictures too! I’m good
at art. Where are you from?
What do you like doing Ben?
I like writing emails. I like
watching films at the cinema.
